                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is an RPG Maker game. I don't expect much from it but there are couple of basic game design issues I want to cover.\n\nFinal battle was not well balanced. Not playtested. It was ridiculously easy, but impossible if you don't farm to lvl 16 first for Edge. Level carry over would've made this way less unecessary, or just straight up one game. All it was, was heal Edge with potions, keep the others alive with potions, just so edge can use Family Trinity over and over again. Not very exciting. Using the skills earned from my Chosen 1 playthrough would've made for more exciting gameplay simply because the others fighting would've been more dynamic.\n\nAlso, why did you remove story elements? We OGs knew that Azion's power was the reason the girls were in their underwear. They were stripped bare and couldn't wear clothes anymore due to her magic! Also the reason for the \"weathering\" of Akaye and Sakae's clothing. Akaye and Sakae's clothing were repaired in the later updates. Serenity's roasting of Edge visiting mom all the time was also removed.",
